OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer calls for compensation over
OL,4,ADunwich fire help
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer who helped firefighters tackle
OL,7,Fa heathland wildfire has criticised the
OL,8,FNational Trust for not sharing part of
OL,9,Fthe #600,000 it has since received in
OL,10,Fdonations.
OL,12,FParts of Dunwich Heath and RSPB
OL,13,FMinsmere on the Suffolk coast went up
OL,14,Fin flames on 29 July, with the blaze
OL,15,Fdestroying an area the size of 210
OL,16,Ffootball pitches.
OL,18,FSpencer Campbell, 21, who spent two
OL,19,Fdays helping fight the blaze, accused
OL,20,Fthe National Trust, which runs Dunwich
OL,21,FHeath, of "profiteering" and said
OL,22,Ffarmers like him should be compensated.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
