OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer calls for compensation over
OL,4,ADunwich fire help
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the trust said it
OL,7,Fwas "immensely grateful for the heroic
OL,8,Fefforts of local farmers" but any
OL,9,Fsuggestion that it sought to profit
OL,10,Ffrom the incident was "unfair and
OL,11,Funtrue".
